        "summary":  "Anthropic has implemented a text watermarking system for Claude to comply with the EU AI Act, using a method derived from Google DeepMind\u0027s SynthID-Text approach. The watermark subtly influences word selection during generation by altering the source of randomness, creating an imperceptible but cryptographically detectable pattern. The system carries no performance penalty, produces no extra tokens, and an upcoming detection API will allow verification of Claude-generated content.",
        "execSummary":  "Enterprises using Claude now have a built-in mechanism to detect AI-generated content, which has direct compliance implications under the EU AI Act. The watermark works by steering word selection at generation time, leaving a cryptographically verifiable signature that survives light edits but not rewrites. For customer-support and content-operations leaders, this creates a new tool for auditing AI output and demonstrating regulatory compliance ΓÇö but it should not be treated as a fraud-detection system, as it only signals Claude involvement, not authorship or ownership. Watch for the forthcoming detection API, which will determine how actionable this capability becomes in practice.",
