        "summary":  "Axonius, a SaaS cybersecurity asset intelligence platform, implemented secure multi-tenant AI agents using Amazon Bedrock AgentCore, evaluating three isolation patterns ΓÇö pool, bridge, and silo ΓÇö before selecting dedicated runtimes per customer with isolated microVMs per user session. The architecture uses Amazon VPC Lattice for private networking, Bedrock Knowledge Bases with tenant-specific metadata filtering for RAG, and JWT-based authentication. The implementation reduced the estimated development cycle from eight weeks to ten days.",
